From 9739603b0f3fee4985c18d7407f3f3c4de05d865 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:29:12 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18g: route modified link opens to host tab
 creation

Route gestured HTTP(S) OpenURLFromTab foreground/background/window/split dispositions through a separate host callback over the existing bounded creation queue. Preserve original Chromium navigation parameters, initiator, referrer policy and navigation callback. Host supplies a distinct blank tab in the source profile and reports selection; source/profile close, replacement and timeout withdraw. Retire queued initial blank navigation before loading retained params, including extension creation. ABI 1.39 / bridge 0.41.0 (link_open_requests); p96 and synthesized native Command, Command-Shift, middle, Shift and Option-Command click cases pass, including HTTP Referer/noreferrer verification, profile/target rejection and lifecycle cancellation, with no outside connection. Existing ABI layouts remain unchanged; explicit rel=opener/non-HTTP URL-only opens remain unsupported.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
